{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04909","headline":"奉和幸礼部尚书窦希玠宅应制 · 李乂","name":"奉和幸礼部尚书窦希玠宅应制","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"家住千门侧，亭临二水傍。\n贵游开北地，宸眷幸西乡。\n曳履迎中谷，鸣丝出後堂。\n浦疑观万象，峰似驻三光。\n草向琼筵乐，花承绣扆香。\n圣情思旧重，留饮赋雕章。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李乂","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_04909.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04909","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}